### =================================================================
### nonstopcoding - Authentication API Testing File
### This file can be run directly inside IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code REST Client
### =================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/nonstopcoding

### 1. Register a new account
# Expected result: 200 OK with User details, and sets HttpOnly cookies (access_token & refresh_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "displayname": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com"
}

###

### 2. Login to account
# Expected result: 200 OK with User details, and sets HttpOnly cookies (access_token & refresh_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3. Refresh Access Token
# Expected result: Reads 'refresh_token' cookie automatically and issues a new access token / cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Logout
# Expected result: Blacklists active tokens and clears access_token/refresh_token cookies (maxAge = 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
